OL,3,AAustralian wrestler Bronson Reed dies
OL,4,Aaged 38, WWE says
OL,5,
OL,6,FProfessional wrestler Bronson Reed has
OL,7,Fdied aged 38, World Wrestling
OL,8,FEntertainment (WWE) has announced.
OL,10,FThe company said the wrestler, whose
OL,11,Freal name is Jermaine Haley, died on
OL,12,FFriday due to medical complications but
OL,13,Fdid not give further details.
OL,15,FPaying tribute, WWE added: "Jermaine
OL,16,Fwas a larger-than-life figure in WWE,
OL,17,Fbut more importantly, he was a
OL,18,Fphenomenal person, a devoted family
OL,19,Fman, and a beloved colleague."
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
